(Title) Tj
T*
(Integrating digital technology with direct patient support to improve TB medication) Tj
T*
(adherence: protocol for a pragmatic randomized trial) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Abstract) Tj
T*
(Tuberculosis remains a leading infectious cause of mortality globally, with medication) Tj
T*
(non-adherence driving both treatment failure and drug resistance. Digital tools offer) Tj
T*
(scalable adjuncts to clinical supervision, yet real-world implementation barriers remain) Tj
T*
(incompletely understood. The TB Treatment Support Tools \(TB-TST\) intervention combines a) Tj
T*
(smartphone application delivering personalized medication reminders, educational content,) Tj
T*
(and bidirectional communication with a reliable, objective adherence biomarker \(urine drug) Tj
T*
(metabolite assay\). This pragmatic randomized trial protocol describes evaluation of TB-TST) Tj
T*
(integrated with standard directly observed therapy in four urban TB treatment centers in) Tj
T*
(Argentina. A total of 90 newly diagnosed TB patients will be randomized 1:1 to standard) Tj
T*
(care or standard care plus TB-TST. Primary outcomes are treatment completion rates and) Tj
T*
(medication adherence measured by metabolite testing at predetermined intervals. Secondary) Tj
T*
(outcomes include patient satisfaction, technical usability, cost-effectiveness, and) Tj
T*
(qualitative insights into implementation barriers and facilitators. This study aims to) Tj
T*
(generate evidence for scalable, patient-centered digital adherence strategies in TB) Tj
T*
(programs.) Tj
